The built-in cartridges (Dexed_01 and SynprezFM_01–32, from upstream Dexed's assets/builtin_pgm.zip) are a DX7 program compilation by Jean-Marc Desprez, author of SynprezFM (http://www.synprez.com/SynprezFM), distributed as in upstream Dexed.

Upstream Dexed's README (https://github.com/asb2m10/dexed, line 85) credits them as:

* DX7 program compilation : Jean-Marc Desprez (author of [SynprezFM](http://www.synprez.com/SynprezFM))

They are distributed with the plugin, as in upstream Dexed.
